{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1277,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09941b5f7c1efedb2f4a3bde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も1日、お疲れさまでした。\r\n“のんかへいん”のお茶っこでも\r\n飲みながら、まったりしませン？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e73a7a6e949e56f293b4e258249e696b63108465a44b1a4a6286a2cd90debc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8911c241de931b634aae26d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もう遅いからそろそろ着替えねば。\r\nあ、メイクも落として…むむむむ…\r\nもったいねぇからまだ着てます～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61c2e287c36c826578ad53480cd6feee966ea1cd9e174e5589a6c3d6479eb75e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef087441ec543d0218bdcc28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は卒業、入学、出会いの季節。\r\nごあいさつに桜饅頭の手土産は\r\nいかがですか～、なーンて…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4501172990acff8ef2d4e9d650a1c85affba485a65e1a349534cc56f5dce36fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5522cf2bb801c202d43070cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏のチョコ作りは難しいです。\r\n暑くてなかなか固まらねぇ…いっそ\r\n盛岡の高原で作ってくるべか…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df880e707cb2ce299c624f37d5722f74af7af0994be9441fa19bef0fcb42d52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b71d327cf1275e40b63fea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋のレースシーズン、燃えますね！\r\nしっかり体作るためにも、体にいい\r\nさつまいもの和菓子さ食べますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52fd12b5bff73fbba88f8cae3883aefbf420a0effc5902b55bd1784103397561",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62ec2b3191f6a8ea0c6e2e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袖をまくると少し寒ぃけど、\r\n盛岡の冬に比べれば暖けぇがら、\r\nぜーんぜん余裕ですよ～っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3764e75ed1fc387b02643c93230c3877f5b1412b739edffab91bf205166f4556",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd64041abf48edf4ce26b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a4bdf43cd22a2d814b9e21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64edd8d16888418cecb874a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シチーさんが、あたしに似合う色の\r\nこすめを選ンでくれるって…\r\nこ、こンな贅沢いいンだべか～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf37c1ea08ba20f03add051d8c85f5b01af4b41bbcaa7b5cebef161506b660ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c24b66564f8819b7fb49bdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奖券同学可是运动全能哟！\r\n不管是滑雪还是滑冰\r\n都非常非常擅长，很帅气呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d979b27c64614042d820746b899d4f0214da3a289fe996451c94db5668b802",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c8a17850fefaf12ad8ff2f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进王同学她在别人苦恼的时候\r\n会“唰”地出现，“磅”地\r\n为他们加油。真热血呀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64236e1e9769a15afc4236b81667b6666728650b8069dea692a57527dac6a74e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8791ed4bf41419cae02dda8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "茶座同学每次一回到房间里的时候\r\n就能闻到咖啡的香味～\r\n……仔细闻了闻之后就被她笑话了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd775e70e84bc58a719ec7e336d86f4e10b32ce39fe84c2d2a3701c71e9d1589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc968b023cf22bd2e9eeb0dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发小的美冬她不管是跳舞\r\n还是唱歌都很擅长的哦！\r\n她有时会在电话里告诉我诀窍呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1304c0f74b69b8574688376c15c908e1c3498424bbf704adca3d7848d85d1957",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587a4201ba0d58c299ec48f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然能和大家穿一样的衣服是很开心啦，\r\n不过我穿着合身吗？\r\n没、没有太不合群……吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "267184da3e7ad7017613d5352788a31405890b4c657d9de4fa0506755759fc9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ae4f9259e2ff61a5232fc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在电视里看到这样闪闪发光的\r\n衣服时就一直在憧憬着了。\r\n没想到自己真能穿上什么的……有好好努力真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fda7e9b58a39cdac3af79d9971bb511dd480c7aed38a302a32634965f051d89e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:602b6217894d2981ac1d8097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花的刺绣绣的好细致啊……！\r\n鞋子上的织物也是毛茸茸暖呼呼的，\r\n真是太奢侈了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4129ff985feacef0089a57440fb86029a0b49cded9510d18c5b07f0d7c26c1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e59c108fafb7c895342a027",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为这是和我一同向“成为城市女孩”\r\n的梦想前进的衣服……\r\n所以可得要好好珍惜呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4bf285487bacc596a4fa0e2fa1841a74af36c4af29cf695c2554b66f59a0156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:542999ef94b0e33728dd3765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种编发很快就可以编好，\r\n就算是睡过头了也没关系！\r\n……虽然也不能睡懒觉就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ebc3c1aeebc09f36e669ec7ca99495b0db4948c4e14c08e884c45b12ccc50f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccb8e771d4c5185260b23646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的课也要加油了！\r\n刚刚在课上突然被点到了，\r\n下了我一跳呢……集中注意集中注意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bbee3a68ceff1e83691ea0ede8fba5e121de7db5abaf24a40e1d98d2ec8cb15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e948a0b16a9649034a91e2e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里就算到了晚上附近也很亮呢~！\r\n去市中心的话估计会更加闪闪发光吧\r\n……就像是电力的星空一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ee2a8640ecbfcbd0db64bc01597572ff158ae51760563a2986184b8ac7fd6c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edd7f8749a8d98d1b1629f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要寒冷的季节一过去，\r\n身体就变得轻快起来了呢。\r\n要一起悠闲地喝杯茶吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7a4e527cb2b96c9d723032c85acacd4d0148358f413539d2bce09139f03349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f67397b6a63e019a6ab3db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到夏天的话就是三飒舞！\r\n幸福呀 快快到来吧♪\r\n像这样，就会打起精神了哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d2fe9cf6c4c984a9c4340e62123863095b2250b3590720609550d35b791ed06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74555f81976b021eee233565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能细致地感受到秋天真不错呢。\r\n老家那边的秋天一下子就过去了，\r\n这里能好好欣赏红叶真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ea1dd96a285de8ed89042b4c5cd2f5521df541e187540d192cd08ec0a4ddc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa7b37c3ea5bcfb2e0641118",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪祭上的冰灯真的很漂亮啊……\r\n之前在回来后有试过对着雪人\r\n打手电去模仿呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85b8c4625764458520c53be55a3b4f78efbe661f417683b4fb3cd9c18f3b6f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f63d16353d6852ca3f878c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛岡には昔ながらの\r\n素敵な喫茶店が多いンです。\r\nカフェさんを案内したいなぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1045c25940002d0a79ac78e22197ac3370aa00482414cac3c849eea28dee7ec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40a480ac9a626fd30f1d86f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フライトさんは着付けもできンだ。\r\n洋服と“もだん”に“こーで”\r\nすンだと！シャレてンなぁ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a90820e02ff12c861cba316808d965b78c3b6d660f0b7fc91a8427ccf1e531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f87d4a700cf3d951e85638f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノフワフワ…サクサク…ンン～\r\n『サクラモチモチオー』に匹敵する\r\n新しい和菓子は、浮かばンです…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a31225841d334e7f21f6ca9a8cc941a4b8329f4b3d94c4778e91440c8b51eafd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b45a3d1568a08237d0d92bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なに着ても、なンのこすめ使っても\r\nチケゾーさんは『かわいいい！！』\r\nって言うンです。ンもう～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05bb62270616560052663dfda75b9bfe7a7a400c0cc1ab1eae601c726063e7d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7385bfc6dc97c15213edffc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実家への土産菓子は多めにせねば。\r\nいつのまにか1つ消えてる時とか\r\nあンので…子どもの笑い声と共に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80f1476df0a36f53dc00c32cd8933ee393a45f2aba13ef95183df6f19a8bdd34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12247171191e3b9627d250c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "職人の朝は早ぇンです。\r\n“シチーガール”も早起きして\r\nヘアメイクすっがら一緒ですねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36175e2de7d0d810ebda73e9668aff696386cefe8e1a6eff852f011b33fb4f39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e25d744068083b7469927e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地元にいた時はよく\r\nあんバターコッペパン食べてたな。\r\n学生のお昼の定番なンですよ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0465c559a2832cc2c64394991cb0902fc3ca540a02c4f0737e5a3a368e1fac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14e2979bf1795e4743288e84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜食のカロリーが気になる時は、\r\n香り高いビターチョコを1粒…。\r\nほわぁ…都会の娘って感じだべ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5057713d9f405ce0ff276c550d6b163667de5bd5143f33e12f065c2c196aa418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c43d9c5aaf4a6bedbac7bf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は桜味の和菓子もいっぺぇだ。\r\nお父ちゃんも好きなンだ、桜味。\r\n豊かな風味のやつが特になぁ…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ffd57c0204862317af743ea128327b679c2b992cd7a1b0782ab17bf1c6b599d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a2d7063a941c53397286ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このエプロン外せば、夏祭りにも\r\n行けそうですよね。動きやすいから\r\nさんさもいっぺぇ踊れそうです～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "30cefb49a6e7a4eac0bbe107702c525296f0bd665a796740d2603c34ed9a0494",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2149cdb033bd2514f5b1c72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "芸術の秋は着物の柄を眺めるのも\r\nいいですよ。染め物、織り物は\r\n地元でよく見たので懐かしいです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e548af7934fc63e7e031ecdfe08a0ad2985e6e18354b4dec7372ca65fd38fc9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fee89ba296f96ee39aaca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぐらんでばにらすのーそいほいっぷ\r\nほわいとちょこそーすちゃいらて…\r\n言えた！これで冬限定の買える…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b023c419de478cda9ced825cbe531780ae6809d796e11f02f4ae0601b14f663",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5422ca91543a6f37a10462e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エプロンの飾りのチョコせんべいは\r\n若者に人気の盛岡土産なンです！\r\n素朴なお菓子も進化してンですよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa7f626e875e890bf1474504af12ab4af22fd33c120f2554b7c1d86fb09b9ce5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5f0a0f325cee34393ef9a3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ポニテ…オシャレに結えてます？\r\n巻いてみたい気もすンですよね。\r\n伸ばしてみるのもアリだべか…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9a75a202a58c2a301c7e3febc865efbf224418f4ab768196d7924145e84900",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f722c4dc2caaaccd70e3c120",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要进行怎样的训练呢？\r\n激动激动、激动激动…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2e0d9ba23d9447f6956ef1dddfb06440275678995a89669984f33a444f24c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a48c55f58e21cdcf56dff9c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "がんばっぺぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8385f94e1873bdd172591437663f1daa0cadf3fba6cf2207696f753e7fa1314e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31949b29d022135f0cd26706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是怎样的训练清单都交给我吧！\r\n我会以雪国的毅力加油的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4980cdee3669f2d24c4a7f2aba81de07f7a0ec6ed1957b214e5eba137426b26b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eed502dae3a308a5859d4b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“城市女孩”修行，\r\n开始了呗——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85233e6d26f926bd43fda52a1f76701556695659daab7681939479b5ad0dfe27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5da1eae27b4d8aab5fde238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天晚上我看了关于训练的书\r\n进行了想象训练！\r\n……虽然感觉还是很模糊就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "122b4c2b8a895446e2294ae0550472de76f886e1619a272c54ff765f43deb41b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cf1a21bab4a951a3a4627f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信着能够全力支持我的，训练员你！\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d288c126476ad776ea26d501795ca694727673999baf7828023ed8cc9fa434",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2cc27e334bd0d993da6e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员是训练员真的真的太好了！\r\n……嗯？感觉稍微有点拗口呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84aec64a4428e1296b25288d1585bb0f891f73b702cec435aac36260c45b5c8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c8d8431817a35dfdee6064",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要成为我想成为的“城市女孩”\r\n如果是训练员的话，\r\n绝对绝——对，可以将其实现的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b0cab7597049411fd25fa6398f4e50e8caa3d7b565041458321e2db15e53e8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c18f6ca27958342440248ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里的海不怎么能见到黑尾鸥呢～\r\n听不到它们热闹的“miamia”声\r\n的话，就感觉缺了点什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b4d1f0d1e2499e85418f05484cc601be9cd8ed9eabbc283b5ca364ebf9d5d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbad29f7164076b9517d218f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングをがんばると\r\nおやつが美味しくなりますよねぇ。\r\n今日は何を…っとと、集中集中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e74534a32d19b7a875c9c5aa886e24b5bbb2c03b1d2785f8da1328391e1fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc75cf38fb3571cb0ed77ac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お抹茶を点てるように\r\nしゃかしゃか走りますよっ！\r\nレースは甘くねぇですからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6507e4b4a2297099c8dc72067fcece21e4cbaa42066d31fff69e2d9c22a10ec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae31892302148554463d1c2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はどんなトレーニングです？\r\nあんこ練りで鍛えた筋肉、\r\nお見せしますよーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f862b27682b17693cc85c9beb02a515cd25e875651e35e79ba8ac796005d2ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f3206444c707c9055201a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たすきがけ、ほどけねえように\r\nしっかり結んできました！\r\n何でも来いですっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae3765fdd7b5669de29e69bcd0c7796117efe6992732cfef6504ae1d8339e85a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861b544a0ff53d70ded6929e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつもどおりに落ち着いて\r\nむつむつやるのが大事ですよね。\r\n特別じゃなぐてもいいンです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "781b106321540d0c0ca88c03bbcb39f2b69cb5067551d79bbce139fe42e60d12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef5c852cc8b7ec9832f27dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つ、疲れたらお茶っこと和菓子で\r\nひと息入れましょうね。そのぅ…\r\nチョコの和菓子作ってきたので…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e1098765fe3a1677025ff96fd2c745ddac463967203f137de67a8663862aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce1569d7eaff58ab124998a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんが見守っててくれる\r\nから、安心してがんばれます。\r\nこれまでも、これからも…です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1773249d9bbeb6c1d5a33ae116383c8b56818f4e5c0b6e88e75f672482225bc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081684526cb22667e179da60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于成为真正的“城市女孩”了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f034aa593aa506061e4e6979513a6004653cf9cf06ae6d98bf2f106ad6e0b0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3fd7a22047b3e0fcc7fc91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托您的福，取得了很好的结果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dc717aa7266163546a886a10ac1765df21aa9bbdcec560153f6992fc39d6499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307a9a61df9d67ef9a2a1b14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あなたの穏やかな笑顔に、励まされました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51d963e23fc07f0e8492b57ee72b204d69af85394d2ce103b4459139f6ba73f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4cc62d2f525035d2ad49b9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真心とご指導、ありがとがんす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13efcaa73407687672d8627f9317b16d88648eae10416d509921624e9861dfe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b8daed20c9bf6da6a680e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得越来越强了呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ba53c83dc858f9204215a7ac2c9e62746a0a39e493fd75bc18a0fb36740973",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a99efd4d016e71f2eabc3ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是崭新的“我”～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f79bd3338111a120cc893ce85ac21cedca028b7ea4c92132a92e6d1ebe283ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e5d75681367e8e3f6342f5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是！我是雪之美人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8dc4565fd47e6c989c2e554d203619f0b992ba205562785eb7f0e119121f459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:757805557bc6e5ad25999bba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对绝对会成为，\r\n憧憬的“城市女孩”的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f433266cfd5da32d14533d913c9b338eb4e99ba5ed8a2ba04b91282a2694bc8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f5a27da848c4b6b14cde9d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "需要支援的话，就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4776378152ac5193718b058295ca0ac11a9c2ba5ca236f06f216ef25fdf2e11e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59c7599fc0b370638524b9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪国的毅力，就让你们见识下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "644d669883e2be5f56bdb4519becc70a87b18eb14d167d3e663f529bdb7a14bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2d95dad33ba4297d6adc172",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もーっと、んめぐしますよ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f974c18387cf8fa0fa0228d7f25c4a0e1fd78983e89be7606bd6f3f7dd84bb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:239ab71c5bbcc5c0982593e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今までの味、超えるなはんっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88efd36e5fcb6dd40b6b61618fbf77b66141d141ee4587e31f62ac38b79fde49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f973d1f0d4fd3ec2a0dc4f0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おでんせ！\r\nほっとする和菓子、いかがです？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb42f9c466cf016e474ce77f2048467838097d21692a5ac194445ea5d3aa27b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:750b336a2bedbcbb55b2335c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノビジン！\r\n一応、看板娘です～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d171eb497287c6c7516393072ac24bc8f5a34c496198453174596c4117d38eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c01da6e6ae77d67bf2a5283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发ー…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d15c8f496c4e0a1ae21e320dcabf7f63e1b6b2847911f0158188baf24d40121b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97a8cb347c663981fb012ef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天都，虽然只有一点点，\n但逐渐接近想成为的自己…了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ec64afa6e62694bf5168d059447d2060bd6cf1b6ed020efde73aa3ec3c97acd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5936105fbea418abcdeae4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "22ec8548daac11d32380b504a3538d645f1fe46c0323029f6d3267d1f56eb8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644c8be3d8e80593e692763a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d8d81aedc68445fb8334730b6c72f38e8457b7886a4254fc48fbe2960e9f15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17adcf6f35040d177cdea0ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥…这个，那个…\n米浴，每天都会努力的。\n…也会慢慢地改变，相信我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c96371f67301ad4ac6ea1a3707b27cdefa54bae2b375f43b05f798d42fc234a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f32313fd85f94fdb972d7d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在呢。米浴对于自己…\n已经不会全部都讨厌了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9de52c0f702375192f7380908dce1308d33ac40fba35af17a4ea9caa240f7c9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3918a194fbf763bd0a65c047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\n…那个，哥哥…米浴今年也\n请多多指教…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94ae2cffe64959ee0a3db79bb2ff24f75192e86df1d50f36b247a4bff3400e94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:610d932c23bcd49c7820611b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其…其实呢，我做了，巧克力…\n虽然是米浴做的，也没关系吧…？\n如果能收下的话我会很高兴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e0222ee615871055d817c90e9e447a85e77dcdc3b195eb30358a3f0351d666a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3311a10ae7361541d85588d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥。因为是情人节…\n和米浴一起做巧克力吧！\n食谱已经写好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d82b6bb3d6f190e27356e3bb4518067ce16eec996d619124f4d43f99fa5fa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507855c11f65a4e309cee7a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星星能实现大家的愿望，\n让大家幸福，真了不起呢。\n米浴也…嗯，要加油了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "490a292a0d586bab696cb3ca9979aea5b466bc8d688ff14e40ceca6e5b876d0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:837a999d76c7f509480c7d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有点心也不会对你\n恶作剧哦…米浴也可以说一下，吗？\n不…不给糖·就·捣蛋…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4af0365e36ed9cbef987f089889260b8eb8e58dd586d285901d8dc402df5b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55508a35ab99771ef2485474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人的绘本\n有很多哦。每一个都\n洋溢着幸福，所以我很喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c502c84bad79c62dba808b2f6f73d08e446707968f38c95bd8e66d3eb5bb66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "10008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
